    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two uses of ber-",
     "texto": [
      "In **beraroma** and **berbau**, **ber-** shows that something has a scent or smell. In **bermobil** and **bermotor**, it refers to travelling by vehicle."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
